### Dashboard API Tests

@host = http://localhost:8080/api/v1


### Get Dashboard Statistics

# @name getDashboardStats

GET {{host}}/dashboard/stats HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{adminAuth}}


### 


### Get User Dashboard Statistics

# @name getUserDashboardStats

GET {{host}}/dashboard/user/stats HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{adminAuth}}


### 


### Get Analytics Data (default date range - last 30 days)

# @name getAnalyticsDefault

GET {{host}}/dashboard/analytics HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{adminAuth}}


### 


### Get Analytics Data with Custom Date Range

# @name getAnalyticsCustomRange

GET {{host}}/dashboard/analytics?startDate=2024-01-01T00:00:00&endDate=2024-12-31T23:59:59 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{adminAuth}}


### 


### Get Analytics Data for Last 7 Days

# @name getAnalytics7Days

GET {{host}}/dashboard/analytics?startDate=2024-01-09T00:00:00&endDate=2024-01-16T23:59:59 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{adminAuth}}


### 


### Get Post Status Distribution

# @name getPostDistribution

GET {{host}}/dashboard/posts/distribution HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{adminAuth}}


### 


### Get Engagement Statistics

# @name getEngagementStats

GET {{host}}/dashboard/engagement HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{adminAuth}}


### 


### Get Recent Activity

# @name getRecentActivity

GET {{host}}/dashboard/recent HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{adminAuth}}

##
